IT Landscape & Legacy Systems:
Legacy System Integration Complexity

Connecting old legacy systems to modern cloud apps increases architectural complexity due to:
 -Incompatible data structures requiring custom middleware or complex API translation layers.

Cost Savings via IT Landscape Diagrams

An IT Landscape Diagram visually identifies financial inefficiencies in two primary ways:
 -End-of-Life (EOL) Asset Tracking: It highlights aging software facing termination of vendor support. This allows SuperMart SA to retire high-maintenance systems before support fees escalate or security breaches occur.

